@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@draftId = replace-with-draft-uuid
@submissionId = replace-with-submission-uuid
@auditId = replace-with-audit-uuid

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Structured request (safe default; no LLM)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/order-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "6204",
  "quantity": 500,
  "primary_brand": "SKF",
  "fallback_brands": ["FAG"],
  "max_unit_price": "250",
  "delivery_deadline": "2026-08-17T09:00:00",
  "allow_split_fulfillment": false,
  "requires_clarification": false,
  "clarification_questions": []
}

### Text shadow request (requires explicitly configured local Ollama + shadow)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/order-requests/from-text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Need 500 SKF 6204 bearings, maximum 250 UAH each. FAG is an allowed fallback. Delivery deadline is 2026-08-17 09:00."
}

### Read draft
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/drafts/{{draftId}}
X-Demo-Actor-Id: demo-viewer
X-Demo-Actor-Role: viewer

### Approve draft
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/drafts/{{draftId}}/approve
X-Demo-Actor-Id: demo-manager
X-Demo-Actor-Role: manager

### Forbidden submit: manager lacks SUBMIT_ORDER permission
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/drafts/{{draftId}}/submit
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-Actor-Id: demo-manager
X-Demo-Actor-Role: manager

{}

### Valid submit: idempotency key and ERP correlation ID are server-owned
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/drafts/{{draftId}}/submit
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-Actor-Id: demo-operator
X-Demo-Actor-Role: operator

{}

### Manual retry for PENDING/UNKNOWN submission
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/submissions/{{submissionId}}/retry
X-Demo-Actor-Id: demo-operator
X-Demo-Actor-Role: operator

### Lookup-only reconciliation; never creates an order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/submissions/{{submissionId}}/reconcile
X-Demo-Actor-Id: demo-operator
X-Demo-Actor-Role: operator

### Read privacy-aware audit detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/extraction-audits/{{auditId}}
X-Demo-Actor-Id: demo-admin
X-Demo-Actor-Role: admin

### Audit summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/extraction-audits/summary
X-Demo-Actor-Id: demo-admin
X-Demo-Actor-Role: admin

### Runtime summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/extraction-runtime/summary
X-Demo-Actor-Id: demo-admin
X-Demo-Actor-Role: admin
